  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(81)/(13) div((176)/(16)-(98)/(49)) times (2197)/(169)\n\nFormula Used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c49e9ef184ad3a244b4a0e325f1c03fdf73a234e5d04e86e969336de19771c93.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(81)/(13) div((176)/(16)-(98)/(49)) times (2197)/(169)\n\n⇒ (81)/(13) div(11-2) times (2197)/(169)\n\n⇒ (81)/(13) div(9) times (2197)/(169)\n\n⇒ (81)/(13) times (1)/(9) times (2197)/(169)\n\n⇒ (81)/(13) times (1)/(9) times 13\n\n⇒ (9)/(13) times 13\n\n⇒ 9\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 9.**",
